Really, all we need is
the death certificate there.

29
00:01:09,937 --> 00:01:13,022
- So, if you don't mind.
- Oh. Uh, yes.

30
00:01:13,023 --> 00:01:14,983
- Ah, yes!
- Here you are.

31
00:01:14,984 --> 00:01:17,110
- Okay, there it is.
- Boom! Done, dead! Yes!

32
00:01:17,111 --> 00:01:19,904
- We got it! Nice. Thank you.
- We did it.

33
00:01:19,905 --> 00:01:20,989
You're welcome.

