37
00:01:30,273 --> 00:01:32,375
- Oh, uh, sure.
- Yeah?

38
00:01:32,376 --> 00:01:33,584
- That'd be great.
- Thank you.

39
00:01:33,585 --> 00:01:36,254
- Assuming you want in on this. Come on.
- Are you kidding me? Of course.

40
