Let's do it on three, yeah?

41
00:01:37,339 --> 00:01:38,423
- Yeah. Okay.
- All right, ready?

42
00:01:38,424 --> 00:01:40,050
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

43
00:01:42,678 --> 00:01:45,763
- Boom!
- Did not disappoint.

44
