Dee, we are about to get rich.

45
00:01:49,995 --> 00:01:52,873
Not

46
00:02:11,290 --> 00:02:14,209
{\an8}Mom, home sweet home, huh?

47
00:02:14,877 --> 00:02:16,127
{\an8}Are you happy to be back?

48
00:02:16,128 --> 00:02:19,380
{\an8}Hey, Frank, the guys are saying no
