78
00:03:26,031 --> 00:03:28,074
Oh, God. Clowns.
"I'm a sad clown."

79
00:03:28,075 --> 00:03:29,817
But they're gonna throw my mom
out on the street.

80
00:03:29,818 --> 00:03:32,829
I don't care. No moms, no funerals.
