Just give him the whole thing.

104
00:04:18,625 --> 00:04:21,043
That's all for you and it's time
to transfer the money to us.

105
00:04:21,044 --> 00:04:22,962
Now, is that going to be
a wire transfer

106
00:04:22,963 --> 00:04:25,298
