108
00:04:27,342 --> 00:04:28,843
- Oh, like Scrooge McDuck!
- Yes!

109
00:04:28,844 --> 00:04:30,803
- Scrooge McDuck! Yeah...
- I've always wanted to pull--

110
00:04:30,804 --> 00:04:32,638
This looks good.
You got everything in order here.

111
