170
00:07:04,708 --> 00:07:06,083
Wait, wait, wait, shut up.

171
00:07:06,084 --> 00:07:07,918
Sorry, if a hand job is not your thing,

172
00:07:07,919 --> 00:07:10,087
I'm sure Mom could do something
much more aggressive.

173
00:07:10,088 --> 00:07:11,131
Bonnie is dead?

174
00:07:11,882 --> 00:07:13,674
Well, yeah,
that's what I just said, yes.

175
00:07:13,675 --> 00:07:15,844
And the Mummers are throwing a funeral?

176
00:07:16,636 --> 00:07:18,471
Yeah, but that...
that's not the issue.

177
00:07:18,472 --> 00:07:20,514
If you've gotten used to
a more sexual lifestyle--

178
00:07:20,515 --> 00:07:22,100
- Shut up.
- Yeah.

179
00:07:22,768 --> 00:07:25,227
Take your mother to your uncle Donald.

180
00:07:25,228 --> 00:07:28,022
Why? Why would I do that?
W-What's going on with Uncle Donald?

181
00:07:28,023 --> 00:07:30,233
- I thought you didn't like him.
- I don't.

182
00:07:30,901 --> 00:07:32,552
But we could use him.

183
00:07:33,904 --> 00:07:36,948
This could be good.

184
00:07:40,619 --> 00:07:42,411
Hey, how you doing?

185
00:07:42,412 --> 00:07:44,163
Do you remember us?

186
00:07:44,164 --> 00:07:45,581
Yes, I believe you're the people

187
00:07:45,582 --> 00:07:48,292
who recommended
I throw your mother in the trash.

188
00:07:48,293 --> 00:07:50,586
Oh, well, you know,
we said a lot of other things too.

189
00:07:50,587 --> 00:07:53,506
Yeah, it was just a suggestion.
Yeah, yeah, it was one idea.

190
00:07:53,507 --> 00:07:56,926
Yeah. Um, we... we feel like we need
a little bit more time with the body

191
00:07:56,927 --> 00:07:58,010
if that's okay with you.

192
00:07:58,011 --> 00:08:00,137
We really rushed
our goodbyes the first time.

193
00:08:00,138 --> 00:08:03,849
Yeah. Got a little excited and sort of
forgot the most important part, you know.

194
00:08:03,850 --> 00:08:07,937
- Do you mind if we pop back in there?
- And slam the door a bunch more times?

195
00:08:07,938 --> 00:08:10,398
- No. I mean, well...
- No, no.

196
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,524
- No.
- We did that.

197
00:08:11,525 --> 00:08:13,734
- No, we're not gonna do that.
- 'Cause that door's all wonky now.

198
00:08:13,735 --> 00:08:14,902
- Is it?
- Super wonky.

199
00:08:14,903 --> 00:08:16,153
And those doors aren't cheap.

200
00:08:16,154 --> 00:08:18,239
- It seems like maybe they are.
- We didn't know.

201
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:20,324
- No. Very, very expensive.
- Oh, wow, sorry about that.

202
00:08:20,325 --> 00:08:21,617
Like I said, we got excited.

203
00:08:21,618 --> 00:08:24,912
I get excited too.
I get excited, but I don't slam them.

204
00:08:24,913 --> 00:08:26,373
I just gently close them.

205
00:08:27,332 --> 00:08:30,127
- Seems like a wasted opportunity.
- Yeah, that's on you.

206
00:08:30,627 --> 00:08:32,461
- Can we go in there?
- One quick ask.

207
00:08:32,462 --> 00:08:34,797
You don't want us to slam the door.
You're obsessing about that.

208
00:08:34,798 --> 00:08:37,133
- Yeah, I don't even want to.
- $60,000 door.

209
00:08:37,134 --> 00:08:39,260
- I honestly don't...
- Whoa, that's a lot.

210
00:08:39,261 --> 00:08:41,178
- It sure is. I got it out of my system.
- Just be careful.

211
00:08:41,179 --> 00:08:42,930
- Don't know about you.
- Don't even want to slam it.

212
00:08:42,931 --> 00:08:44,390
Okay.

213
00:08:44,391 --> 00:08:47,436
We're gonna slam the door.
- Oh, absolutely.
- Okay.

214
00:08:49,438 --> 00:08:52,773
All right, Dee. Let's get this goddamn
thumbprint and get the hell out of here.

215
00:08:52,774 --> 00:08:55,109
- Okay. How we gonna do that?
- Uh, with the ink pad.

216
00:08:55,110 --> 00:08:56,111
We don't have an ink pad.

217
00:08:56,903 --> 00:08:58,904
- You didn't bring one?
- You didn't tell me to.

218
00:08:58,905 --> 00:09:01,574
All you said was, "Dee, I have an idea."
That's all you said.

219
00:09:01,575 --> 00:09:03,451
I thought
we were just gonna get the thumb.

220
00:09:03,452 --> 00:09:04,535
Get the thumb?

221
00:09:04,536 --> 00:09:07,621
In case we need to use it retroactively
for other documents or something.

222
00:09:07,622 --> 00:09:09,415
I don't know.

223
00:09:09,416 --> 00:09:13,085
Well, now, see, that's interesting.
Dee, that is interesting.

224
00:09:13,086 --> 00:09:14,920
Yeah, that's a good point. You know what?

225
00:09:14,921 --> 00:09:17,757
Yeah, slide the arm out, get the thumb,
and keep her face covered

226
00:09:17,758 --> 00:09:19,467
'cause I don't wanna look at her while
you're doing it.

