Mac! Mac! Mac!

465
00:20:16,707 --> 00:20:18,583
I'm so sorry, Uncle Donald.

466
00:20:18,584 --> 00:20:22,213
I knew that my dad was going
to double-cross you the entire time.

467
00:20:22,839 --> 00:20:26,591
- Are you mad?
- No, Son. I'm not mad.

468
00:20:26,592 --> 00:20:28,677
Dad? How?

469
00:20:28,678 --> 00:20:32,089
I never told Donald
he could take my place in the parade

470
00:20:32,473 --> 00:20:35,267
'cause I knew you were gonna rat.

471
00:20:35,935 --> 00:20:39,147
Once a rat, always a rat.

472
00:20:40,898 --> 00:20:43,909
Oh. Does this mean you're gonna live
as him with Mom now?

473
00:20:46,112 --> 00:20:47,988
Uh, okay. Will I see you again?

474
00:20:47,989 --> 00:20:51,917
Oh, yeah. I'll probably come back
to kill you someday.

475
00:20:56,122 --> 00:20:59,000
Eh. He's just being unpleasant.
I'm sure he'll come around.

